    "accessibility": [],
    "description": "On this guided tour, you'll have the chance to explore the Reina Sofia Museum and the Prado Museum, two of Madrid's most important art museums. During the tour, your knowledgeable guide will lead you to the most important works of art in both sites. You'll see the masterpiece of famous artists such as Diego Velázquez and Francisco Goya in Prado Museum and paintings by Pablo Picasso and Salvador Dalí in Reina Sofia Museum. \r\n\r\nWhile strolling through the museums, your guide will give invaluable insights into the cultural and historical significance of the paintings. You'll be able to learn about 20th-century Spanish artworks and the most influential art movements, from abstractionism to cubism, surrealism to modernism.",
